## Git Commit Style

```
feat: add drag-and-drop field reordering
fix: prevent 500 when submitting to unpublished form
chore: add aiosqlite to test dependencies
docs: add data model table to README
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`. One line, imperative mood, no period.
